1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,855
Welcome to the construction site.

2
00:00:02,805 --> 00:00:11,263
On this site there are eleven stations, one for each optimization and related rates problem of the guide that can be seen at real scale.

3
00:00:11,263 --> 00:00:16,023
To go to a station, choose it in the stations menu or walk to it.

4
00:00:16,023 --> 00:00:22,327
On the computer, drag with the mouse over the scene to rotate the view and use the wheel to zoom in.

5
00:00:22,327 --> 00:00:30,611
With the headset, walk with the left joystick, turn with the right one, and use the menu on your left: point and pull the trigger.

6
00:00:30,611 --> 00:00:39,760
Each station has a panel with the equations and a graph of the function, and you can move the variable of the problem to see how everything changes at once.

7
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:45,957
You can repeat this explanation whenever you want, or turn the narration off with the narration button.

